text-slate-900 mb-6 leading-tight\">Sua saúde, mais inteligente</h1><p class=\"text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-600 mb-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed\">Conectamos seus dados de saúde com inteligência artificial para revelar padrões, antecipar riscos e oferecer orientações personalizadas que realmente funcionam.</p><div class=\"mb-8\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-teal-600 to-cyan-600 text-white rounded-xl hover:shadow-xl hover:scale-105 transition-all font-semibold text-base\">Começar gratuitamente<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-5 h-5\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-6 text-sm text-slate-600\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield w-4 h-4 text-teal-600\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path></svg><span>LGPD Compliant</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock w-4 h-4 text-teal-600\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg><span>Dados Criptografados</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text w-4 h-4 text-teal-600\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg><span>Cofre de exames</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 px-4 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4\">Seus dados de saúde trabalham por você</h2><p class=\"text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">Transformamos informações espalhadas em insights acionáveis para sua saúde preventiva.</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-teal-50 to-cyan-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-teal-100\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-teal-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-bot w-6 h-6 text-white\"><path d=\"M12 8V4H8\"></path><rect width=\"16\" height=\"12\" x=\"4\" y=\"8\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M2 14h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 14h2\"></path><path d=\"M15 13v2\"></path><path d=\"M9 13v2\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2\">IA Médica Avançada</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600\">Análise inteligente dos seus dados para identificar padrões e correlações invisíveis a olho nu.</p></div><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-indigo-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-blue-100\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-blue-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield w-6 h-6 text-white\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2\">Prevenção Inteligente</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600\">Detecta riscos antes que se tornem problemas sérios. Receba alertas personalizados baseados no seu histórico.</p></div><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-green-50 to-emerald-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-green-100\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-green-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-trending-up w-6 h-6 text-white\"><polyline points=\"22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17\"></polyline><polyline points=\"16 7 22 7 22 13\"></polyline></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2\">Progresso Visível</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600\">Dashboards personalizados que mostram sua evolução em tempo real com métricas que importam.</p></div><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 to-orange-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-amber-100\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-amber-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-camera w-6 h-6 text-white\"><path d=\"M14.5 4h-5L7 7H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v9a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-3l-2.5-3z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"13\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2\">OCR Médico</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600\">Tire foto dos seus exames e deixe a IA extrair e organizar automaticamente todas as informações.</p></div><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-pink-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-purple-100\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-purple-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users w-6 h-6 text-white\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2\">Saúde Familiar</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600\">Gerencie a saúde de toda família em um único lugar. Perfis separados e seguros para cada membro.</p></div><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-50 to-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-100\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-slate-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-message-square w-6 h-6 text-white\"><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2\">Assistente 24/7</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600\">Converse com IA especializada em saúde que conhece todo seu histórico e contexto pessoal.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-16 px-4 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 to-slate-800\"><div class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 text-center\"><div class=\"p-6\"><div class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-teal-400 mb-2\">Grátis</div><p class=\"text-slate-300\">Comece sem cartão de crédito</p></div><div class=\"p-6\"><div class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-teal-400 mb-2\">100%</div><p class=\"text-slate-300\">Seguro e LGPD compliant</p></div><div class=\"p-6\"><div class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-teal-400 mb-2\">Cofre</div><p class=\"text-slate-300\">Seus exames num só lugar</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 px-4 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-50 to-white\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4\">Para quem é o Onya?</h2><p class=\"text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Solução completa para diferentes necessidades de saúde</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-teal-400 hover:shadow-lg transition-all\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-gradient-to-br from-teal-500 to-cyan-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-activity w-7 h-7 text-white\"><path d=\"M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2\">Diabético/Hipertenso</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4\">Controle glicose, pressão e medicamentos</p><button class=\"text-teal-600 font-semibold text-sm hover:text-teal-700 flex items-center gap-1\">Começar agora<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-teal-400 hover:shadow-lg transition-all\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-gradient-to-br from-teal-500 to-cyan-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-baby w-7 h-7 text-white\"><path d=\"M9 12h.01\"></path><path d=\"M15 12h.01\"></path><path d=\"M10 16c.5.3 1.2.5 2 .5s1.5-.2 2-.5\"></path><path d=\"M19 6.3a9 9 0 0 1 1.8 3.9 2 2 0 0 1 0 3.6 9 9 0 0 1-17.6 0 2 2 0 0 1 0-3.6A9 9 0 0 1 12 3c2 0 3.5 1.1 3.5 2.5s-.9 2.5-2 2.5c-.8 0-1.5-.4-1.5-1\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2\">Mães e Gestantes</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4\">Acompanhe vacinas, crescimento e consultas</p><button class=\"text-teal-600 font-semibold text-sm hover:text-teal-700 flex items-center gap-1\">Começar agora<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-teal-400 hover:shadow-lg transition-all\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-gradient-to-br from-teal-500 to-cyan-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-user-plus w-7 h-7 text-white\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><line x1=\"19\" x2=\"19\" y1=\"8\" y2=\"14\"></line><line x1=\"22\" x2=\"16\" y1=\"11\" y2=\"11\"></line></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2\">Cuidadores de Idosos</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4\">Gerencie múltiplos medicamentos</p><button class=\"text-teal-600 font-semibold text-sm hover:text-teal-700 flex items-center gap-1\">Começar agora<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-teal-400 hover:shadow-lg transition-all\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-gradient-to-br from-teal-500 to-cyan-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-dumbbell w-7 h-7 text-white\"><path d=\"m6.5 6.5 11 11\"></path><path d=\"m21 21-1-1\"></path><path d=\"m3 3 1 1\"></path><path d=\"m18 22 4-4\"></path><path d=\"m2 6 4-4\"></path><path d=\"m3 10 7-7\"></path><path d=\"m14 21 7-7\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2\">Atletas</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4\">Treino + dieta + medidas conectados</p><button class=\"text-teal-600 font-semibold text-sm hover:text-teal-700 flex items-center gap-1\">Começar agora<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"bg-white border b